{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 🚀 VSCode 替代 Keil5 工具链\n\n开源组合拆解 Keil 四合一 IDE：\n编辑器 + GCC编译 + OpenOCD调试 + 器件包",
      "x": 400,
      "y": -260,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "main_doc",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "01.VSCode替代Keil搭建STM32开发环境.md",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "tools",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "🌟 核心四件套\n- VSCode（编辑器）\n- GNU Arm Toolchain (arm-none-eabi-gcc)\n- OpenOCD（调试/烧录后端）\n- STM32CubeMX（生成工程）\n\n插件：STM32 VS Code Ext / C-C++ / Cortex-Debug",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "config",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "🔧 三个配置文件\n- tasks.json：build / clean / flash\n- launch.json：Cortex-Debug + OpenOCD\n- *.cfg：interface + target 认芯片\n- .svd：外设寄存器视图",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "debug",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "🐞 在线调试实战\n- F5 启动 → 停 main\n- 断点 / 单步 / 变量 / 内存\n- 外设视图翻转 GPIO.ODR 看 LED\n- 改码 → Ctrl+Shift+B → F5 下板",
      "x": 780,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "pit",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "⚠️ 坑 & 课程关联\n- ARMCC≠GCC 二进制\n- ST-Link 驱动 / target not halted\n- 中文/空格路径过敏\n- TI 平台(课)→CCS 不可替代\n- STM32自玩→VSCode 完全够",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
